# CineScope React Native

This is a client-quality clone of the Flutter CineScope UI, built to test React Native. It is not a Flutter port.

## Source of truth

- Execution: `docs/roadmap.md`
- History, once implementation starts: `docs/project_log.md`

If a request conflicts with the roadmap, follow the roadmap and say so.

## Frozen product

Match the screens, copy, colors, and TMDB calls in the roadmap. No new screens, endpoints, or backend.

## Stack

Expo stable SDK, TypeScript, Expo Router, TanStack Query, Zustand, Zod, `fetch`, `expo-image`, AsyncStorage, StyleSheet.

## Substitution

No Firebase, Google Sign-In, or Firestore. Sign-in is a local session. Watchlist and watched lists persist on device.

## Do not

- Scaffold or overwrite `docs/`, `.cursor/`, or `AGENTS.md`
- Install packages that are not on the roadmap allowlist
- Copy Cubit, Bloc, or `useReducer` ViewModel patterns from the Flutter app
